Z||000006||hyhy4u||06-17-2001||07:37 PM||||There was only one size sunroof ever available, you could check your RPO codes to see if it origanally came with one, and i dont know how your cars are 4 inches different, if ya figured out how ya managed that one tell me, i would love to know.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
