Z||000009||rockcrawl||06-18-2001||07:29 AM||||FYI, All factory sunroofs are not the same. They are all the same size, and yours is not one of them, but there is a difference in the tinting of the glass. The early cars had a mirror shade on the bottom and the late cars had a dot matrix pattern.||||reg||1
